; lake_waterfall_path.room - Trilha da Cascata: a climb of single jumps (rises of 3, gaps of 4 or less) up a
; cliff beside the static waterfall (cols 6-13), from the Mill's river (bottom) to the lake (design 04 section 3.5).
; No gate: base kit. The bench stands on the west stub beside the river mouth.
; The side walls stay flush between the steps: a wall ledge there leads nowhere (WORLD-35).
; West opening at rows 41-44 onto the row 45 stub into village_garden (STORY-05); [back] rock at col 0, rows 40-45, hides the backdrop cut.
; Row 0 closed: a drawn rock ceiling over a room inside rock (WORLD-34, "Drawn rock ceiling, all five (Recommended)", user, 2026-10-14).

